  "description": "Listed Building Consent: Repairs to the external structure and fabric including repairs and re-rendering to external chimneystacks and replacement of associated chimneystack leadwork; recovering pitched slate covered roofs and replacement of associated leadwork and flashings; recovering flat roofs and wide flat valley gutters between pitched roofs; new replacement external flat roof access hatch; repairs and refurbishment of existing cast iron rainwater goods and replacement of existing defective cast iron rainwater goods; replacement of existing plastic eaves gutters with new cast iron eaves gutters; repairs to existing eaves line and gable joinery including fascia boards, bargeboards, eaves and gable under soffit boards/linings and moulded timber projecting eaves brackets; new lightning protection system incorporating air rods and down conductor tapes; new external bird control measures; new roof safe access system for safe access for future maintenance; removal of existing external light fittings; external redecoration.   ",
